<article class="env-lemma" id="0DPM">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0DPM">Lemma <span data-tag="0DPM">108.10.1</span>.</a> The diagonal of $\mathit{Mor}_ B(Y, X) \to B$ is a closed immersion of finite presentation. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      There is an open immersion $\mathit{Mor}_ B(Y, X) \to \mathrm{Hilb}_{Y \times _ B X/B}$, see Quot, Lemma <a href="/tag/0D1B" data-tag="0D1B">99.12.2</a>. Thus the lemma follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/0DM6" data-tag="0DM6">108.7.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>